AgressiveDragon(Patrolling) {

* (Patrolling)
| Struck(Projectile) ? Hit(1) :(LifeCheck)
| Closest(Team, 5) ? 92% Move(F, 3) / Orient(L) / Orient(R) :(Patrolling)
| Closest(Team) ? :(Chasing)
| True ? 92% Move(F, 3) / Orient(L) / Orient(R) :(Patrolling)

* (Chasing)
| Struck(Projectile) ? Hit(1) :(LifeCheck)
| Closest(Team, 5) ? 92% Move(F, 3) / Orient(L) / Orient(R) :(Patrolling)
| Closest(Team, F) ? Move(F, 3) :(Chasing)
| Closest(Team, L) ? Orient(L) ; Move(F, 3) :(Chasing)
| Closest(Team, R) ? Orient(R) ; Move(F, 3) :(Chasing)
| Closest(Team, B) ? Orient(L) ; Move(F, 3) :(Chasing)
| True ? Move(F, 3) :(Chasing)

* (LifeCheck)
| Life(0) ? Explode :(Dead)
| True ? :(Patrolling)

* (Dead)
| True ? Rest :(Dead)
}